{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54518","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"徴音姓，赤色火烧金。\n非火（京本作「是」）克金成大器，青云（京本作「赢」）黄助黑云凶（辛本作「白云黑气现黄云」）。\n军将祸（京本作「尽」）殃深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}